// Seki Senshi, ADR-0032: lines heard in the metro car during a ride, `metro_ride_<n>`.
// Extras, ads from the speaker and station calls in Japanese and Polish (stations per ADR-0042). No choices: the ride
// scene picks one and shows it as subtitles while the destination district streams in.

=== metro_ride_1 ===
GLOSNIK: Tsugi wa Plac Litewski, Plac Litewski desu. Next stop: Plac Litewski, Krakowskie Przedmieście. Doors open on the left.
PASAZER: Krakowskie. I'm telling you, there's a bar by the promenade where nobody asks your name. Because nobody knows it.
-> END

=== metro_ride_2 ===
GLOSNIK: Tsugi wa Brama Krakowska desu. Next stop: Brama Krakowska, Stare Miasto. Please mind the gap between the car and the platform.
PASAZERKA: The gap between the car and the platform has been the same for ten years. They should list it as a monument.
-> END

=== metro_ride_3 ===
GLOSNIK: Tsugi wa Plac Zamkowy desu. Next stop: Plac Zamkowy, Podzamcze. Change here for the bus station and night lines.
DZIECKO: Mom, why is that man sleeping standing up?
PASAZERKA: Because he works for Tessen, sweetie. That's how they rest.
-> END

=== metro_ride_4 ===
GLOSNIK: Tsugi wa Nabrzeże Bystrzycy desu. Next stop: Nabrzeże Bystrzycy, Tessen zone. Passengers without a Tessen pass are asked to remain in the car.
PASAZER: You can get off without a pass. You just have to explain to security afterwards why you got off.
-> END

=== metro_ride_5 ===
REKLAMA: Forget your bad days! Kagami Biotech, memories made to measure. First edition free, the rest by subscription.
PASAZER: First one's free. My dealer used to say the same.
-> END

=== metro_ride_6 ===
REKLAMA: Tessen Kōgyō. We build the riverside, we build the future, we build you. Now recruiting dockers. Helmet provided.
PASAZERKA: The helmet's provided. The head you have to look after yourself.
-> END

=== metro_ride_7 ===
The car sways on a curve. Someone sleeps against the window, someone eats a cebularz out of foil. On the screen over the doors, the forecast: rain, rain, acid rain.
PASAZER: Forty years I've ridden this line and not once seen the sun over the Wieża Trynitarska. But I believe it's there.
-> END

=== metro_ride_8 ===
GLOSNIK: Ojamashimasu. We apologize for the delay. A cat was found on the tracks. The cat is safe. The train will depart once the cat agrees.
-> END

=== metro_ride_9 ===
PASAZERKA: Did you hear? Supposedly on Krakowskie there's a girl from a wreck who cleared the Hebi out from behind the car wash all by herself.
PASAZER: Rumors. On Krakowskie somebody takes out somebody every day. They only sing about some of them.
-> END

=== metro_ride_10 ===
GLOSNIK: Kono densha wa, saishū densha desu. This is the last train tonight. Please do not leave luggage, memories or implants on board.
-> END
